WEBVTT

00:00.270 --> 00:04.440
<b>Episode 9: Best Friend with Him</b>

00:17.830 --> 00:19.830
<i>Mornin', Mona.</i>

00:17.870 --> 00:19.830
<b>Today</b>

00:23.080 --> 00:24.210
<b>Today</b>

00:23.400 --> 00:26.270
<i>Whassup? It's still so early...</i>

00:26.270 --> 00:27.330
<i>Listen up.</i>

00:27.330 --> 00:29.630
<i>I'm actually in Tokyo right now!</i>

00:31.380 --> 00:32.520
<i>For real?</i>

00:32.520 --> 00:33.100
<i>Let's meet up!</i>

00:33.100 --> 00:34.240
<i>We gotta hang out!</i>

00:34.490 --> 00:35.800
<i>Darn right we do!</i>

00:35.800 --> 00:38.050
<i>It's been, what, a year an' a half?</i>

00:38.050 --> 00:40.180
<i>I'm stoked!</i>

00:40.180 --> 00:41.620
<i>Same!</i>

00:41.620 --> 00:42.210
<i>Oh!</i>

00:42.210 --> 00:44.570
<i>I know where your school is!</i>

00:44.570 --> 00:46.270
<i>I'll come pick ya up?</i>

00:46.820 --> 00:48.490
Uh...

00:50.520 --> 00:51.550
<i>Don't you dare.</i>

01:20.470 --> 01:20.890
<b>m 82 222 l 159 118 327 136 364 231 332 300 146 325</b>

01:20.470 --> 01:20.890
<b>Medaka!</b>

01:21.140 --> 01:21.890
<b>m 255 63 l 290 32 404 38 432 83 404 116 286 114</b>

01:21.140 --> 01:21.890
<b>Why are you
always so mean
to Mona-chan?</b>

01:21.140 --> 01:21.890
<b>m 92 258 l 114 236 171 228 225 239 246 266 236 300 214 317 140 318 88 292</b>

01:21.140 --> 01:21.890
<b>Do your tenets
not tell you to be
nice to people?</b>

02:17.320 --> 02:24.030
<b>Medaka Kuroiwa
Is Impervious to My Charms</b>

02:17.320 --> 02:24.030
<b>Medaka Kuroiwa
Is Impervious to My Charms</b>

02:29.770 --> 02:32.380
Yo, wanna go karaoke after school today?

02:32.380 --> 02:34.690
I'm in. And you, Medaka-kun?

02:34.690 --> 02:36.380
I don't have any songs I can sing.

02:36.380 --> 02:37.330
Wha?

02:37.330 --> 02:39.410
Surely you've got at least one.

02:39.410 --> 02:40.920
The Heart Sutra, maybe?

02:40.920 --> 02:41.890
Are you serious?

02:43.330 --> 02:45.770
<i>Sigh... He's so dreamy.</i>

02:49.710 --> 02:50.500
Hm?

02:58.650 --> 03:01.660
<b></b>Student ID

02:58.650 --> 03:01.660
<b></b>Asahi Shonan

02:58.650 --> 03:01.660
<b></b>Name:



Birth date:


Enrolled:

02:58.650 --> 03:01.660
<b></b>This card certifies the above
person as a student of this school.

03:02.020 --> 03:05.100
Did you watch last night's 
<i>Not Falling for Foxy's Tricks</i>?

03:05.100 --> 03:07.860
I did! That was crazy!

03:08.760 --> 03:11.810
So, whatcha gonna do, Asahi?

03:11.810 --> 03:12.460
Huh?

03:12.460 --> 03:16.410
Mona-senpai's clearly got 
the upper hand as things stand.

03:16.990 --> 03:18.170
I mean...

03:18.510 --> 03:22.760
I'd like to change that, but how?

03:22.760 --> 03:26.890
I didn't expect him to kiss her 
at the end for a cliffhanger!

03:27.150 --> 03:29.490
That was so romantic!

03:29.490 --> 03:33.780
I wish someone would 
take my lips the same way!

03:34.150 --> 03:36.400
You'll have to take his lips by force?

03:36.770 --> 03:38.730
Wh-What are you saying?!

03:39.830 --> 03:42.400
Um, is Shonan-san here?

03:46.940 --> 03:48.030
It's a second-year.

03:48.030 --> 03:50.290
What's he want with Shonan-san?

03:50.680 --> 03:52.410
You dropped this.

03:52.410 --> 03:53.920
<b></b>Student ID

03:52.410 --> 03:53.920
<b></b>Name:

03:52.410 --> 03:53.920
<b></b>Birth date:

03:52.410 --> 03:53.920
<b></b>Enrolled:

03:52.410 --> 03:53.920
<b></b>Asahi Shonan

03:52.410 --> 03:53.920
<b></b>This card certifies the above
person as a student of this school.

03:54.240 --> 03:56.550
Huh? That's...

03:57.940 --> 04:00.230
Oh, thank you very much.

04:01.110 --> 04:02.880
Okay, I'll be going, then.

04:02.880 --> 04:05.150
Please wait, Kuroiwa-senpai.

04:05.150 --> 04:06.180
What's up?

04:06.180 --> 04:09.280
Um, do you have any plans for lunch?

04:09.280 --> 04:11.060
H-Hey, Minami!

04:11.390 --> 04:12.110
Huh?

04:12.560 --> 04:16.940
Did you bring your own? 
Or are you gonna buy something?

04:17.860 --> 04:20.820
Uh... I was thinking of picking up a sandwich.

04:20.820 --> 04:23.620
Asahi says she'll treat you.

04:23.620 --> 04:24.240
Huh?

04:24.240 --> 04:25.870
She will? But why?

04:25.870 --> 04:30.730
I mean, you deserve to be repaid for 
coming all this way to give the ID back...

04:30.730 --> 04:32.010
says Asahi.

04:32.010 --> 04:33.420
Wait, what?!

04:35.660 --> 04:37.300
This is your chance, Asahi.

04:37.300 --> 04:39.680
But... th-this is nerve-wracking.

04:39.680 --> 04:42.630
Go grab yourself a kiss or two.

04:43.790 --> 04:45.130
Kiss?!

04:45.540 --> 04:47.760
Please let her, Senpai!

04:50.190 --> 04:53.840
O-Okay, I'll take you up on that.

04:57.180 --> 04:58.520
I agree.

04:58.520 --> 05:01.190
You seem to be in a good 
mood today, Mona-chan.

05:01.450 --> 05:05.450
You can tell? My childhood bestie 
is in Tokyo right now.

05:05.710 --> 05:08.160
Oh, from back home?

05:08.450 --> 05:12.710
Yep, can't wait to see her. It's been ages.

05:12.710 --> 05:18.920
<i>But... why is Tomo even here? 
What about school?</i>

05:22.570 --> 05:23.800
<i>Is this for real?</i>

05:24.210 --> 05:28.050
<i>I'm with Kuroiwa-senpai... 
and we're a-all alone!</i>

05:28.320 --> 05:31.340
U-Um, is it good?

05:31.340 --> 05:33.760
I... I mean the sa-sa-sandwich!

05:33.760 --> 05:35.560
Huh? Yeah?

05:36.150 --> 05:37.790
<i>What am I even saying?!</i>

05:37.790 --> 05:41.160
<i>It's bread from the school store! 
It can't be bad!</i>

05:41.770 --> 05:45.320
<i>I'm having lunch with a girl... 
Clear mind, clear spirit.</i>

05:45.970 --> 05:48.210
<i>My face is burning up.</i>

05:48.210 --> 05:52.260
<i>I'm here with Senpai, but I'm 
too nervous to even look at him.</i>

05:52.260 --> 05:53.530
<i>What do I do?</i>

05:54.330 --> 05:55.660
<i>I know.</i>

05:55.660 --> 05:57.820
K... Kuroiwa-senpai!

05:58.920 --> 06:01.920
<b>dun</b>

05:58.920 --> 06:01.920
<b>dun</b>

05:59.610 --> 06:01.920
Wh-What is this?

06:01.920 --> 06:05.290
I-I'm sorry for springing this on you.

06:06.090 --> 06:06.920
But...

06:06.920 --> 06:12.350
<i>This way, I can look at him all I want.</i>

06:16.010 --> 06:18.020
<i>I'm so happy right now.</i>

06:18.560 --> 06:22.930
<i>If... If I were his girlfriend,</i>

06:22.930 --> 06:26.440
<i>could I spend time with him 
like this whenever I wanted?</i>

06:27.250 --> 06:30.280
Go grab yourself a kiss or two.

06:33.250 --> 06:39.500
I-I wish we could've hung out more 
during the Halloween party.

06:41.030 --> 06:43.250
I still don't think it's too late.

06:43.660 --> 06:45.190
Shonan-san?

06:45.590 --> 06:47.850
Trick or treat.

06:47.850 --> 06:50.590
Give me a treat, or I'll play a trick on you.

06:50.910 --> 06:52.470
Trick or treat.

06:52.820 --> 06:54.350
N-Now?

06:54.660 --> 06:56.470
Trick or treat.

06:56.470 --> 06:59.010
I-I don't have any treats.

06:59.010 --> 07:01.400
Heck, I can't even see.

07:01.890 --> 07:04.870
Trick it is, then.

07:13.070 --> 07:15.490
Wh-What was that?

07:17.550 --> 07:18.740
Not telling.

07:22.370 --> 07:26.250
Aww, I dropped my octopus wiener.

07:44.460 --> 07:48.620
Say, any cafes nearby that you'd recommend?

07:48.620 --> 07:51.650
I just got here from Osaka.

07:52.450 --> 07:56.060
If ya tell me, I'm thinkin' we 
could grab a coffee together,

07:56.060 --> 07:57.890
Mr. Handsome?

07:57.890 --> 07:59.080
Let me take you there!

07:59.080 --> 08:00.090
Me too!

08:00.090 --> 08:01.860
A-And me!

08:02.300 --> 08:03.460
Tomo!

08:03.830 --> 08:06.840
Ugh, you never change.

08:08.840 --> 08:09.810
Mona!

08:09.810 --> 08:10.840
Tomo!

08:11.090 --> 08:13.300
Wait, is she with her?

08:13.300 --> 08:15.370
They're both so cute! This is our lucky day!

08:15.370 --> 08:17.640
Where are we going? My treat.

08:19.180 --> 08:20.720
Sorry, deal's off.

08:22.320 --> 08:23.700
Laters!

08:23.700 --> 08:24.650
Goodbye.

08:26.940 --> 08:28.320
Good to see ya.

08:28.810 --> 08:32.030
You could at least wait for me 
<i>without</i> hittin' on some dudes.

08:32.030 --> 08:35.410
No harm, no foul. Oh, here.

08:35.410 --> 08:37.030
Souvenir from home.

08:37.030 --> 08:40.040
Whoo, pork buns!

08:40.040 --> 08:43.790
I bet you've missed 'em 
and the classic Osakan flavor.

08:43.790 --> 08:47.010
Thanks! You're the best!

08:47.010 --> 08:50.920
By the way, Tomo, what about school? 
D'you have today off?

08:51.870 --> 08:54.670
And what brings you to Tokyo? Sightseein'?

08:54.670 --> 08:56.430
Something like that.

08:56.760 --> 08:58.740
Oh, yeah?

08:58.740 --> 08:59.670
Wait, before that...

09:00.930 --> 09:03.930
Aren't you cold in that getup?

09:03.930 --> 09:07.310
Hey, I'm in Tokyo. I had to dress the part.

09:07.310 --> 09:08.520
Mwah.

09:09.370 --> 09:11.020
C-Cute.

09:11.320 --> 09:16.230
Hah. I'm gonna set some 
Tokyo boys' hearts on fire.

09:16.230 --> 09:18.910
I'm amazed you can do that to people 
you don't give a crap 'bout.

09:19.160 --> 09:23.120
Anyway, ain't this pretty far from your school?

09:23.120 --> 09:25.580
We coulda met up somewhere closer.

09:25.580 --> 09:28.700
Listen. I like to compartmentalize my life.

09:28.700 --> 09:33.620
Don't want my homebuds and school pals mixin'. 
Got different masks for different folks.

09:34.890 --> 09:38.640
Wait, you're puttin' on the cutesy 
ditz act at school, aren't ya?

09:40.530 --> 09:42.430
That takes me back.

09:46.940 --> 09:49.720
So cute!

09:53.820 --> 09:56.420
Every boy in school had the hots for ya.

09:56.420 --> 09:59.610
They were tryin' every trick 
in the book to catch your eye.

10:00.050 --> 10:03.620
What's up? Why'd you call me out here?

10:03.620 --> 10:04.490
Listen...

10:04.860 --> 10:07.500
Would you mind goin' out with me?

10:07.500 --> 10:08.370
Huh?

10:08.370 --> 10:10.250
Hold it right there!

10:10.250 --> 10:13.180
Mona-san! Please go out with me!

10:13.180 --> 10:14.710
No, me!

10:14.710 --> 10:17.470
No, it's gotta be me! Be mine!

10:18.440 --> 10:24.040
Sorry, you guys. 
I only see you as good friends.

10:24.040 --> 10:26.270
But you rejected them all.

10:26.540 --> 10:29.770
Man, I wish I was as popular as you.

10:30.030 --> 10:34.020
Listen to yourself. 
Didn't you have a buncha boyfriends?

10:35.630 --> 10:38.600
You okay? Cheer up.

10:38.600 --> 10:39.920
Namba-san...

10:40.910 --> 10:44.660
You went around pickin' up 
all the guys I turned down.

10:44.940 --> 10:48.040
When someone seems down, 
I can't just leave 'em be.

10:48.040 --> 10:52.170
Yeah, right. And not one of 
those relationships lasted.

10:52.170 --> 10:54.920
Heh, I wonder why.

10:54.920 --> 10:59.440
On that topic, I'd like to date a Tokyo boy.

10:59.440 --> 11:01.580
I'm single and ready to mingle.

11:01.580 --> 11:02.800
Yeah?

11:03.080 --> 11:06.140
So, how's it like here? How're the boys?

11:06.440 --> 11:11.140
I wish I could tell you, but I dunno. 
I haven't dated any.

11:11.140 --> 11:14.600
What? You don't have a boyfriend here?

11:14.600 --> 11:18.940
Uh, I'm pretty sure you know this. 
Forget Tokyo, I ain't ever had one.

11:19.280 --> 11:21.340
I can never understand it.

11:21.340 --> 11:26.060
You could have your pick of the men. 
Why don't ya take advantage of that?

11:26.060 --> 11:27.410
Why, you ask?

11:28.330 --> 11:31.910
It's just... I don't get dating 
and all that stuff.

11:32.650 --> 11:36.560
Aha. I guess you're still pure, deep down.

11:36.560 --> 11:39.420
You haven't experienced real love yet.

11:39.730 --> 11:42.610
Yikes. Quit with the corny lines.

11:42.610 --> 11:43.930
That's kinda cringe.

11:44.270 --> 11:47.700
I mean you haven't truly fallen for anyone yet.

11:47.700 --> 11:51.180
So what? Not like you know 
what true love is, either!

11:51.500 --> 11:54.690
Uh-huh? Okay, anyone 
you're interested in, then?

11:54.690 --> 11:56.060
Nope.

11:56.460 --> 11:58.070
Not even one?

11:59.340 --> 12:01.110
Not even.

12:01.110 --> 12:03.450
Nobody's got my interest...

12:06.820 --> 12:09.120
<i>Wh-Why'd I just think of him?</i>

12:09.120 --> 12:11.610
Wait, I know that look. 
There is someone, right?

12:11.610 --> 12:12.700
N-Nope!

12:12.700 --> 12:14.990
I bet you just thought of someone right now.

12:14.990 --> 12:17.090
Who is it? Tell me!

12:17.340 --> 12:20.080
I'm tellin' you, nope. That was just...

12:21.140 --> 12:22.680
<i>M-Medaka?!</i>

12:22.680 --> 12:24.840
<i>Why the heck's Medaka all the way out here?!</i>

12:24.840 --> 12:26.580
K... Kuroiwa-kun?

12:26.580 --> 12:29.100
Wh-What's up? Fancy meeting you here.

12:29.100 --> 12:32.640
Uh, Sho lives around here.

12:33.180 --> 12:35.460
We played rock-paper-scissors, and I lost,

12:35.930 --> 12:38.370
so I gotta pick up our food. 
Just waiting for it now.

12:38.370 --> 12:39.860
Oh, really?

12:39.860 --> 12:42.490
<i>Please hurry up and leave!</i>

12:42.490 --> 12:44.930
What, you know him, Mona?

12:44.930 --> 12:47.650
Come on, come this way!

12:47.650 --> 12:49.870
Come on.

12:49.870 --> 12:53.200
Talk about a lucky break. Come on, sit with us.

12:56.180 --> 13:00.500
Nice to meetcha. I'm Tomo Namba, 
Mona's childhood friend.

13:00.500 --> 13:03.340
And I'm single and lookin' for a boyfriend.

13:04.220 --> 13:07.590
Clear mind, clear spirit. 
Clear mind, clear spirit.

13:04.870 --> 13:08.600
Mind goin' out with me... Huh?

13:09.980 --> 13:11.070
Hmm?

13:14.600 --> 13:16.980
<b>Medaka Kuroiwa
Is Impervious to My Charms</b>

13:19.610 --> 13:21.980
<b>Medaka Kuroiwa
Is Impervious to My Charms</b>

13:25.410 --> 13:26.490
Mona?

13:29.030 --> 13:31.790
Listen, could you get off of me, please?

13:32.090 --> 13:34.080
What? You don't like it?

13:34.080 --> 13:37.790
<i>Clear mind, clear spirit! I am void, void!</i>

13:37.790 --> 13:41.290
C-C'mon, Tomo. You're bothering Kuroiwa-kun.

13:41.800 --> 13:44.120
<i>Something's off.</i>

13:46.810 --> 13:51.600
<i>Wait, is this the guy 
Mona thought of just now?</i>

13:51.960 --> 13:53.390
Mona, one sec.

13:53.390 --> 13:54.240
What?

13:54.240 --> 13:57.300
Just to confirm, is he your boyfriend?

13:57.300 --> 14:00.120
Nope, no way! What are you talkin' about?!

14:00.120 --> 14:01.640
Do ya like him, then?

14:01.640 --> 14:02.440
Nope!

14:02.440 --> 14:04.940
Huh... Then you're okay with it?

14:05.530 --> 14:08.350
Sit tight and watch what I'm about to do.

14:08.350 --> 14:09.040
Huh?

14:11.370 --> 14:14.210
So... Kuroiwa-kun, was it?

14:14.210 --> 14:15.250
Yeah?

14:15.250 --> 14:19.540
Where do Tokyo folk like to hang out? Tell me.

14:19.540 --> 14:22.400
Hey, why're you lookin' away?

14:22.400 --> 14:25.130
P-Please fix your clothes.

14:25.130 --> 14:27.140
My clothes? They seem fine to me.

14:27.140 --> 14:29.320
Z-Zip up your coat.

14:29.320 --> 14:31.800
Aww... If you say so.

14:32.140 --> 14:36.140
Aw, dang. My hands're all 
greasy from the fries.

14:36.140 --> 14:39.270
Oh, I know. Could ya zip it up 
for me, Kuroiwa-kun?

14:39.270 --> 14:40.400
Wha?

14:40.700 --> 14:41.520
<i>Huh?!</i>

14:41.520 --> 14:45.280
C'mon. All you gotta do is zip it up.

14:45.280 --> 14:48.900
Wh-Why me? Ask Mona-chan.

14:49.200 --> 14:51.910
You asked me to zip it up, not her.

14:52.580 --> 14:55.910
So you do it, Kuroiwa-kun.

15:08.570 --> 15:10.960
<i>I-It's stuck on her chest!</i>

15:20.090 --> 15:21.190
<i>Her voice!</i>

15:24.030 --> 15:25.440
That's enough!

15:24.780 --> 15:28.280
<i>Three Dum-Dum sets ready to go!</i>

15:25.700 --> 15:26.520
Huh?

15:28.280 --> 15:29.870
I mean...

15:29.870 --> 15:31.880
Uh... I-It looks like your food's ready.

15:31.880 --> 15:34.260
You should probably go grab it.

15:34.260 --> 15:36.240
Oh, right. Bye.

15:38.440 --> 15:40.290
Bye-bye.

15:48.550 --> 15:51.770
Wh-What? Why'd you burst out laughin'?

15:52.110 --> 15:53.840
It's just so funny!

15:54.170 --> 15:55.850
Did your brain break or somethin'?

15:55.850 --> 15:57.470
It's nothin'.

16:01.570 --> 16:05.050
Mona, I wanna say somethin' before I split.

16:05.050 --> 16:06.110
What?

16:06.110 --> 16:09.360
You like Kuroiwa-kun, don't ya?

16:09.360 --> 16:12.740
Wha?! A-Absolutely not!

16:13.080 --> 16:18.240
Oho? You can't fool your childhood friend. 
I see right through your lies.

16:18.240 --> 16:19.490
Well, you're blind!

16:19.770 --> 16:22.910
Yeah, yeah, whatever you say. See ya later.

16:23.930 --> 16:27.050
What was she even here for, anyway?

16:30.920 --> 16:33.140
Man, I'm starving.

16:33.140 --> 16:34.720
Dude, you just got here.

16:35.430 --> 16:37.690
Everyone, take your seats.

16:39.810 --> 16:42.480
We have a new student joining our class today.

16:42.480 --> 16:44.430
Wait, really?

16:45.800 --> 16:47.230
A transfer student?

16:48.940 --> 16:51.610
I'm Tomo Namba, from Osaka.

16:51.610 --> 16:53.320
T-Tomo?!

16:54.940 --> 16:57.450
Good to see you, you two.

16:58.550 --> 17:01.320
So you had to transfer 
because of your dad's work?

17:01.320 --> 17:02.040
Yep.

17:02.410 --> 17:05.820
Parting with your friends must've been so sad.

17:05.820 --> 17:09.360
It was, but I'm not that worried.

17:09.360 --> 17:10.300
Why not?

17:10.300 --> 17:12.770
'Cause I have a friend out here, too.

17:12.770 --> 17:13.880
Right, Mona?

17:14.140 --> 17:15.840
R-Right you are.

17:15.840 --> 17:17.800
<i>Why'd she transfer to my school? My class?</i>

17:17.800 --> 17:19.510
<i>She's even sittin' right in front!</i>

17:19.790 --> 17:24.140
I never thought I'd get to meet 
Mona-chan's childhood friend so soon.

17:24.140 --> 17:28.400
R-Right? Even I can't believe it.

17:28.400 --> 17:31.870
Any friend of Mona-chan's is a friend of mine.

17:31.870 --> 17:35.120
If you ever need help, come to me!

17:35.120 --> 17:37.020
Nice to meet you.

17:39.890 --> 17:43.240
What a nice class. I'll feel right at home.

17:43.240 --> 17:46.570
Hey, Tomo! Why didn't you tell me about this?

17:46.570 --> 17:47.960
Surprised?

17:47.960 --> 17:49.460
Extremely!

17:49.770 --> 17:52.120
There we go. The surprise makes it better.

17:52.120 --> 17:54.210
I bet you're stoked, deep down.

17:54.510 --> 17:58.590
Not in the least! If anything, I'm ticked off.

17:58.910 --> 18:00.390
I'll expose that act of yours.

18:01.570 --> 18:04.720
I'm so happy to be in the same 
class as you, Tomo!

18:04.720 --> 18:05.640
Atta girl.

18:06.390 --> 18:11.230
<i>I got a bad feeling about this. I hope 
she doesn't go and do anything weird.</i>

18:11.230 --> 18:12.260
Mona-chan.

18:13.270 --> 18:15.860
Mind if we say hi to Namba-san, too?

18:15.860 --> 18:18.530
Always good to have more girls in class.

18:18.800 --> 18:21.160
Nice to meet you. Call me Sho.

18:21.160 --> 18:22.490
I'm Kido.

18:22.490 --> 18:23.790
Nice to meetcha.

18:24.140 --> 18:27.070
Come on, Medaka. Introduce yourself too.

18:27.790 --> 18:29.790
Oh, it's okay.

18:29.790 --> 18:30.890
Huh?

18:30.890 --> 18:31.840
Why?

18:31.840 --> 18:35.160
Kuroiwa-kun and I already 
met yesterday. Right?

18:35.160 --> 18:36.320
H-Hey, there.

18:36.320 --> 18:37.780
Huh? Really?

18:37.780 --> 18:41.230
We ran into each other when Mona 
and I were hangin' out. Right?

18:41.230 --> 18:42.470
R-Right.

18:42.470 --> 18:44.660
Oh, really?

18:44.660 --> 18:46.220
Now, you...

18:46.530 --> 18:51.860
Was it when you went to pick up food? 
How come you get to have all the fun?!

18:51.860 --> 18:54.320
You two are childhood friends?

18:54.320 --> 18:55.010
Yep.

18:55.010 --> 18:57.790
Nice. You two seem close.

18:57.790 --> 19:00.360
You know it. We're, like, <i>super</i> close.

19:00.750 --> 19:03.230
I can even do this.

19:03.910 --> 19:05.660
Right, Mona?

19:09.470 --> 19:10.180
Wha...

19:10.180 --> 19:12.040
Huh? Have they gotten bigger?

19:12.040 --> 19:13.540
You doofus!

19:13.540 --> 19:15.280
Come with me!

19:17.170 --> 19:19.050
What the hell was that for?!

19:19.050 --> 19:22.020
Hey, I used to do it all the time.

19:22.020 --> 19:24.830
And I told you to stop back then, too!

19:24.830 --> 19:26.520
This sucks.

19:26.100 --> 19:36.150
<b>smart smart</b>

19:26.520 --> 19:29.450
How am I supposed to go 
back to class after that?

19:29.450 --> 19:33.210
All I did was show you off to Kuroiwa-kun.

19:33.210 --> 19:36.150
Like, "look at her bangin' nice bod!"

19:37.470 --> 19:39.740
I keep tellin' you, it ain't like that.

19:39.740 --> 19:42.430
The reason I'm hung up on Medaka is...

19:44.120 --> 19:47.830
And there you have it. He's the only one 
I haven't been able to charm.

19:47.830 --> 19:50.700
He's a real tough nut to crack.

19:50.700 --> 19:52.660
You get it now, Tomo?

19:52.660 --> 19:54.960
Nope. I don't get it at all.

19:54.960 --> 19:56.350
Why not?!

19:56.350 --> 20:01.720
Do you not realize? You definitely 
have a crush on Kuroiwa-kun.

20:02.110 --> 20:05.620
<i>What is </i>with<i> her? I just explained it myself!</i>

20:05.620 --> 20:08.790
Like I keep sayin', I'm not!

20:10.030 --> 20:12.890
Fine. Sorry for jumpin' to conclusions.

20:12.890 --> 20:15.650
Oh, you understand now?

20:15.950 --> 20:17.380
Yeah...

20:17.380 --> 20:21.660
Thinkin' about it, he has nothin' 
that'd make you fall for him.

20:23.010 --> 20:26.500
He's unfriendly, and his looks 
are nothin' to write home about.

20:26.500 --> 20:29.040
Don't think he's got a spine to him, either.

20:29.040 --> 20:34.120
Sorry for sayin' you had a crush on him. 
That was rude of me.

20:34.520 --> 20:37.130
Y-You don't have to go that far...

20:37.610 --> 20:38.630
Why not?

20:39.050 --> 20:45.430
Sure, he can be unfriendly, 
but he's kind when it counts.

20:46.300 --> 20:49.960
And he helped me out when I was in trouble.

20:50.900 --> 20:52.180
You look cute.

20:52.180 --> 20:56.230
And he says the right things 
when it really matters.

20:56.670 --> 21:00.910
He doesn't look half-bad, he's earnest,

21:00.910 --> 21:04.170
a-and he's more popular 
with the chicks than you'd think.

21:04.780 --> 21:09.990
He's actually a really nice and cool guy.

21:12.870 --> 21:13.790
What?

21:13.790 --> 21:16.580
Wh-What's with the look?

21:16.580 --> 21:20.550
Mona, you really do like Kuroiwa-kun.

21:20.880 --> 21:23.330
Okay, I see it now.

21:23.330 --> 21:26.130
Man... Mona, of all people?

21:26.540 --> 21:28.590
Wait, no...

21:28.590 --> 21:32.020
Eh, it'll be fine. No need to rush things.

21:32.450 --> 21:35.540
I'll help ya realize it while I'm here.

21:36.030 --> 21:38.450
H-Hey, Tomo? What are you...

21:36.650 --> 21:39.020
What fun! This makes me so happy!

21:39.020 --> 21:42.030
I mean, it's my bestie's first love!

21:42.670 --> 21:44.330
First love...?

21:46.090 --> 21:50.080
You're seriously in love with Kuroiwa-kun.

21:53.220 --> 21:54.410
Wha?

21:55.250 --> 21:59.550
Me? In love with Medaka?

22:04.850 --> 22:08.970
Quit deciding things for me.

23:44.980 --> 23:49.990
<b>Episode 10





Theme Park with Him</b>

23:44.980 --> 23:49.990
<b>Medaka Kuroiwa
Is Impervious to My Charms</b>

23:46.990 --> 23:49.990
Next time: "Theme Park with Him."
